# fresh_host_display_mode_values: RvgDisplayMode takes any double refresh rate, and the display descriptor any size in millimetres. The mode list holds the refresh rate as (uint32_t)floor(rate * 65536 + 0.5), an arm64 conversion that saturates: 0 and anything negative, NaN and -inf give 0; 65536 and above, and inf, give 0xffffffff. The sizes are stored as floats as given, NaN and negative included. Each set_modes bumps the list's counter and interrupts whether or not the values changed.
